<div id="2026-10-22-forager-menu-pills" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-10-22 — Forager application menu uses the body pill buttons</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> On the forager theme the top application menu buttons are the same rounded pills as the home-page hero links. Back gained a back icon. ENCY uses the herb icon. Icon boxes are sized so the existing SVG masks show.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> The application row was plain text. The body navigation was already pill buttons with icons. The menu has to keep its links and dropdowns.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>root/static/css/themes/forager.css</code>, <code>root/static/css/svg-icons.css</code>, <code>root/Navigation/Menu.tt</code>.</p>
</div>
